abstract: "A free, self-paced course in explainable AI for large language models. Five days of guided material built on thirteen open lab notebooks: feature attribution, attention analysis, probing and counterfactuals, explanation-guided attacks, evaluation of explanations, chain-of-thought faithfulness, and mechanistic interpretability."
